{
  "id": "2KI.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "2 Kua̱R 24",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ni̱n ruecdɛ cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ni Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar wec ka̱n, kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim a ja̱ŋdɛ kɛ run diɔ̱k. Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ rɔ luɔ̱c Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ji̱ Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn kɛnɛ bun ji̱ Kɛ̈l-da-ya kɛnɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya, kɛ ji̱ Mo-ab, kɛ ji̱ A-mon, jäk kä Juda, kɛ ɣöö ba wä däk, ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial ëë latdɛ kɛ thok gööknikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ thuɔ̱k cu nɔmɔ ben kä Juda ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial, cɛ kɛ woc muun in cieŋɛ thi̱n kɛ kui̱ dui̱rä Ma-na-thɛ ce̱tnikɛ tëë diaal tëë cɛ la̱t, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kɛ kui̱ riɛm ëë cɛ wuɔ̱th piny baaŋ. Kä cɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm thiäŋ kɛ riɛm baaŋ, kä /ci Kuoth Nhial jɛ bi pälikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim diaal tëë cɛ la̱t gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim li̱w, kä cu gatdɛ ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken kuäär I-jëp lɛ luny muun kɛ ɣöö ca ti diaal ka̱n kä jɛ ɛ kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn tëë la nyin I-jëp, a känɛ ni tɔ̱ɔ̱rä I-jëp a wä ni kiir Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär Juda ni Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë took Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin kuäär tëë kɛ run wäl bädäk kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ Päth diɔ̱k. Kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Nɛ-uc-ta nya Ɛl-na-than kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tnikɛ tëë diaal tëë ci gua̱nikɛ la̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn guäth ɛ mɔ cu ji̱ kɔar Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ben go̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci ji̱ kɔarɛ wec go̱l, cuɛ ben wi̱c ɛn Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin rɔ ka̱m kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn, jɛn kɛnɛ man, kɛ bööth dhɔaarɛ, kɛ ji̱ kɔarɛ. Cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn jɛ la̱th yieenä kɛ bädäk runi ruecdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn nyin luaak Kuɔth Nhial diaal kɛnɛ nyin duëël kua̱r naŋ, kä cuɛ kuak luaak Kuɔth Nhial diaal tin la da̱a̱p tëë la̱tkɛ ɛ Thɔ-lo-mon kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ce̱tkɛ mëë ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ la̱r jɛ tiath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm pɛc kɛɛliw. Kua̱rkɛ diaal kɛnɛ ji̱ ko̱o̱r, kɛ ta̱a̱th diaal, kɛnɛ bel, nɛy ti bathdɔɔri wäl. Cu duɔth ni ji̱ ruɔ̱ɔ̱p kärɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Nɛ-bu-kad-nɛ-dhar Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin, pɛ̈c kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn. Kä cuɛ man kua̱r kɛnɛ män kɛ, kɛ ji̱ kɔarɛ, kɛ bööth wec ka̱n kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm cuɛ kɛ naŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c bä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ji̱ ko̱o̱r diaal ti bathdɔɔri bärɔw, kɛ ta̱a̱th, kɛnɛ bel ti bathdɔɔr nööŋ kä Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn ala pɛ̈ɛ̈c, kɛn diaal kɛ ji̱ ko̱o̱r ti̱n bum. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär Bɛ̈-bi-lɔn gua̱nlen Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin ni Ma-tan-yaa kuany ala kuäär kɛ gua̱a̱th Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kin, kä cuɛ ciötdɛ ri̱t i̱ Dhid-ki-yaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär Juda ni Dhid-ki-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë took Dhid-ki-yaa kuäär tëë kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ kɛl, kä cuɛ ruëc kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛ run wäl kɛl, kä cɔalkɛ man i̱ Ä-mu-tal nya Yir-mɛ-yaa kä Lib-na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, ce̱tkɛ tëë diaal tëë ci Yɛ-ɣo-ya-kim kɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö cu kɛ̈c Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm kɛnɛ Juda kä cuɛ kɛ woc muun in cieŋɛ thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
